flowchart LR
    CLI[CLI: capture / verify / show]
    CAP[CaptureService]
    VER[VerifyService]
    DOM[Domain: Manifest + Artifact + Policy]
    HASH[HashProvider\nstreaming SHA-256]
    GIT[GitInspector\nread-only metadata]
    ENV[EnvironmentCollector\nPython/platform/packages]
    STORE[ManifestStore\nversioned JSON]
    FS[(Repository files)]
    OUT[VerificationResult\ntext / JSON / exit code]

    CLI --> CAP
    CLI --> VER
    CAP --> DOM
    VER --> DOM
    CAP --> HASH
    CAP --> GIT
    CAP --> ENV
    CAP --> STORE
    HASH --> FS
    VER --> HASH
    VER --> GIT
    VER --> ENV
    VER --> STORE
    STORE --> FS
    VER --> OUT
    OUT --> CLI
